{"accepted_at": "2025-09-25T20:16:57Z", "accession": "0000909832-25-000093", "cik": 909832, "exhibit": "EX-99.1", "fiscal_period": "Q4", "fiscal_year": 2025, "lead": "", "period_end": "2025-08-31", "period_start": "2025-05-12", "seq": 0, "text": "Exhibit 99.1", "ticker": "COST", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/909832/000090983225000093/costex9918-k92525.htm"}
{"accepted_at": "2025-09-25T20:16:57Z", "accession": "0000909832-25-000093", "cik": 909832, "exhibit": "EX-99.1", "fiscal_period": "Q4", "fiscal_year": 2025, "lead": "", "period_end": "2025-08-31", "period_start": "2025-05-12", "seq": 2, "text": "COSTCO WHOLESALE CORPORATION REPORTS FOURTH QUARTER AND FISCAL YEAR 2025 OPERATING RESULTS", "ticker": "COST", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/909832/000090983225000093/costex9918-k92525.htm"}
{"accepted_at": "2025-09-25T20:16:57Z", "accession": "0000909832-25-000093", "cik": 909832, "exhibit": "EX-99.1", "fiscal_period": "Q4", "fiscal_year": 2025, "lead": "", "period_end": "2025-08-31", "period_start": "2025-05-12", "seq": 3, "text": "ISSAQUAH, Wash., September 25, 2025 - Costco Wholesale Corporation (“Costco” or the “Company”) (Nasdaq: COST) today announced its operating results for the 16-week fourth quarter and the 52-week fiscal year ended August 31, 2025.", "ticker": "COST", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/909832/000090983225000093/costex9918-k92525.htm"}
{"accepted_at": "2025-09-25T20:16:57Z", "accession": "0000909832-25-000093", "cik": 909832, "exhibit": "EX-99.1", "fiscal_period": "Q4", "fiscal_year": 2025, "lead": "", "period_end": "2025-08-31", "period_start": "2025-05-12", "seq": 4, "text": "Net sales for the quarter increased 8.0 percent, to $84.4 billion, from $78.2 billion last year.", "ticker": "COST", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/909832/000090983225000093/costex9918-k92525.htm"}
{"accepted_at": "2025-09-25T20:16:57Z", "accession": "0000909832-25-000093", "cik": 909832, "exhibit": "EX-99.1", "fiscal_period": "Q4", "fiscal_year": 2025, "lead": "", "period_end": "2025-08-31", "period_start": "2025-05-12", "seq": 5, "text": "Net sales for the fiscal year increased 8.1 percent, to $269.9 billion, from $249.6 billion last year.", "ticker": "COST", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/909832/000090983225000093/costex9918-k92525.htm"}
{"accepted_at": "2025-09-25T20:16:57Z", "accession": "0000909832-25-000093", "cik": 909832, "exhibit": "EX-99.1", "fiscal_period": "Q4", "fiscal_year": 2025, "lead": "", "period_end": "2025-08-31", "period_start": "2025-05-12", "seq": 8, "text": "Net income for the fourth quarter was $2.610 billion, $5.87 per diluted share, compared to $2.354 billion, $5.29 per diluted share, last year.", "ticker": "COST", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/909832/000090983225000093/costex9918-k92525.htm"}
{"accepted_at": "2025-09-25T20:16:57Z", "accession": "0000909832-25-000093", "cik": 909832, "exhibit": "EX-99.1", "fiscal_period": "Q4", "fiscal_year": 2025, "lead": "", "period_end": "2025-08-31", "period_start": "2025-05-12", "seq": 9, "text": "Last year's results included a net non-recurring tax benefit of $63 million, $0.14 per diluted share, related to a transfer pricing settlement, and true-ups of tax reserves.", "ticker": "COST", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/909832/000090983225000093/costex9918-k92525.htm"}
{"accepted_at": "2025-09-25T20:16:57Z", "accession": "0000909832-25-000093", "cik": 909832, "exhibit": "EX-99.1", "fiscal_period": "Q4", "fiscal_year": 2025, "lead": "", "period_end": "2025-08-31", "period_start": "2025-05-12", "seq": 10, "text": "Net income for the fiscal year was $8.099 billion, $18.21 per diluted share, compared to $7.367 billion, $16.56 per diluted share, last year.", "ticker": "COST", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/909832/000090983225000093/costex9918-k92525.htm"}
{"accepted_at": "2025-09-25T20:16:57Z", "accession": "0000909832-25-000093", "cik": 909832, "exhibit": "EX-99.1", "fiscal_period": "Q4", "fiscal_year": 2025, "lead": "", "period_end": "2025-08-31", "period_start": "2025-05-12", "seq": 11, "text": "Costco currently operates 914 warehouses, including 629 in the United States and Puerto Rico, 110 in Canada, 42 in Mexico, 37 in Japan, 29 in the United Kingdom, 20 in Korea, 15 in Australia, 14 in Taiwan, seven in China, five in Spain, two in France, two in Sweden, and one each in Iceland, and New Zealand.", "ticker": "COST", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/909832/000090983225000093/costex9918-k92525.htm"}
{"accepted_at": "2025-09-25T20:16:57Z", "accession": "0000909832-25-000093", "cik": 909832, "exhibit": "EX-99.1", "fiscal_period": "Q4", "fiscal_year": 2025, "lead": "", "period_end": "2025-08-31", "period_start": "2025-05-12", "seq": 13, "text": "A conference call to discuss these results is scheduled for 2:00 p.m. (PT) today, September 25, 2025, and will be available via a webcast on investor.costco.com (click “Events & Presentations”).", "ticker": "COST", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/909832/000090983225000093/costex9918-k92525.htm"}
