{"accepted_at": "2026-09-24T20:17:37Z", "accession": "0000909832-26-000084", "cik": 909832, "exhibit": "EX-99.1", "fiscal_period": "Q4", "fiscal_year": 2026, "lead": "", "period_end": "2026-08-30", "period_start": "2026-05-11", "seq": 3, "text": "ISSAQUAH, Wash., September 24, 2026 - Costco Wholesale Corporation (“Costco” or the “Company”) (Nasdaq: COST) today announced its operating results for the 16-week fourth quarter and the 52-week fiscal year ended August 30, 2026.", "ticker": "COST", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/909832/000090983226000084/costex9918-k92426.htm"}
{"accepted_at": "2026-09-24T20:17:37Z", "accession": "0000909832-26-000084", "cik": 909832, "exhibit": "EX-99.1", "fiscal_period": "Q4", "fiscal_year": 2026, "lead": "", "period_end": "2026-08-30", "period_start": "2026-05-11", "seq": 4, "text": "Net sales for the quarter increased 11.2 percent, to $93.9 billion, from $84.4 billion last year.", "ticker": "COST", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/909832/000090983226000084/costex9918-k92426.htm"}
{"accepted_at": "2026-09-24T20:17:37Z", "accession": "0000909832-26-000084", "cik": 909832, "exhibit": "EX-99.1", "fiscal_period": "Q4", "fiscal_year": 2026, "lead": "", "period_end": "2026-08-30", "period_start": "2026-05-11", "seq": 5, "text": "Net sales for the fiscal year increased 10.1 percent, to $297.2 billion, from $269.9 billion last year.", "ticker": "COST", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/909832/000090983226000084/costex9918-k92426.htm"}
{"accepted_at": "2026-09-24T20:17:37Z", "accession": "0000909832-26-000084", "cik": 909832, "exhibit": "EX-99.1", "fiscal_period": "Q4", "fiscal_year": 2026, "lead": "", "period_end": "2026-08-30", "period_start": "2026-05-11", "seq": 8, "text": "Net income for the fourth quarter was $2.998 billion, $6.75 per diluted share, compared to $2.610 billion, $5.87 per diluted share, last year.", "ticker": "COST", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/909832/000090983226000084/costex9918-k92426.htm"}
{"accepted_at": "2026-09-24T20:17:37Z", "accession": "0000909832-26-000084", "cik": 909832, "exhibit": "EX-99.1", "fiscal_period": "Q4", "fiscal_year": 2026, "lead": "", "period_end": "2026-08-30", "period_start": "2026-05-11", "seq": 9, "text": "This year's fourth quarter was positively impacted by a non-recurring benefit of $0.15 per diluted share from IEEPA tariff refunds received in the quarter, less partial reinvestment of those refunds in increased member values.", "ticker": "COST", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/909832/000090983226000084/costex9918-k92426.htm"}
{"accepted_at": "2026-09-24T20:17:37Z", "accession": "0000909832-26-000084", "cik": 909832, "exhibit": "EX-99.1", "fiscal_period": "Q4", "fiscal_year": 2026, "lead": "", "period_end": "2026-08-30", "period_start": "2026-05-11", "seq": 10, "text": "Net income for the fiscal year was $9.226 billion, $20.76 per diluted share, compared to $8.099 billion, $18.21 per diluted share, last year.", "ticker": "COST", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/909832/000090983226000084/costex9918-k92426.htm"}
